# MASTER PROMPT: BUILD A COMPLETE PROFESSIONAL STUDENT MANAGEMENT SYSTEM

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Act as a senior full-stack developer, UI/UX designer, software architect, database engineer, and QA engineer.

Build a complete, professional, responsive web application named **Smart Student Management System (SSMS)**.

The application must support two primary user roles:

1. Student
2. Teacher

Include an administrative role for managing users, academic records, subjects, and system settings.

The final application must be a working website, not just a UI prototype or a collection of static pages.

Implement the frontend, backend, database, authentication, role-based access control, dashboards, forms, data tables, charts, notifications, and automated tests.

Do not leave buttons nonfunctional, use placeholder links for implemented features, or display hardcoded statistics as if they were live database results.

If an external service is unavailable, provide a working local alternative and document the limitation.

